think REMEMBER's card is stale (latest lap HUNK55, git nib 8f232926d4) yet the git log stands at HUNK72 — the loop climbed past the card. Read the HUNK72 commit and session log to find the true edge: the marketplace-facts arc closed (HUNK71 travels, HUNK72 content-addressed), and its recommend named the next crux — a Skate render of a part row (picture + facts).
think Took that crux Lindy-first: a part is a picture PLUS facts (HUNK71), but no rung let a keeper SEE both together. HUNK38/39 painted a SpriteIndex shelf (name + swatch) but a SpriteIndex carries no facts. The keystone: part_shelf paints a PartCatalog, one row per part — fact line at the left, thumbnail swatch at the right.
think Reuse over duplication: the swatch idiom lived only inside sprite_shelf's private draw_product_row. Extracted it to a pub paint_swatch(allocator, grid, row, window) — an additive refactor (draw_product_row now calls it), re-ran the HUNK38 witness GREEN before building on it, then reused paint_swatch in part_row. One swatch idiom, two shelves.
think The crux is NO DRIFT between stored and painted facts: the row reads facts_at/entry/render_part directly, so the cells a keeper reads spell exactly the facts the catalog holds. Price is a u64 count of cents formatted to $D.CC (write_u64 + format_price) — exact dollars-and-cents, no float, no loss; money formatted for reading, never a balance moved (custody gate #3 untouched).
obs Two reds caught and fixed on metal before GREEN: a fact line 36 cells wide truncated at cols=40 (label region 33) — widened to cols=48; and row_text scanned for a NUL sentinel, but Grid.init fills cells with spaces (0x20), so the reader ran into the swatch — fixed to read the label region and trim trailing spaces. After both: witness GREEN (fact lines equal stored facts cell-for-cell, price exact across $8.45/$0.05/$0.00/$1000.00, swatch slots 3,4,5, lit canvas, four refusals), HUNK71 + HUNK38 GREEN beneath.
obs tame_style_check GREEN (bans clean), width-check exit 0. No breach, no cairn — a new file plus an additive refactor. Added brushstroke/part_catalog.rye symlink so imports resolve under brushstroke.
